
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.Sound(Sound: string|uuid, Volume: number, Queue: boolean, Loop: boolean)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llSound(string Sound, float Volume, integer Queue, integer Loop);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"">Deprecated:  use ll.PlaySound</p>
      <p>  <p>Plays <b>sound</b> at <b>volume</b> and whether it should <b>loop</b> or not.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string|uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>Sound / sound</td>
          <td>a sound in the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Inventory" target="_blank">inventory</a> of the prim this script is in&#32;or a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a>&#32;of a sound</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>Volume / volume</td>
          <td>between 0.0 (silent) and 1.0 (loud) (`0.0 <&#61; <b>volume</b> <&#61; 1.0`)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>boolean</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Queue / queue</td>
          <td>boolean, whether or not to queue the song (<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a>) or interrupt the playing song (<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a>).</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>boolean</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Loop / loop</td>
          <td>boolean, whether or not to loop the song.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>sound</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">85</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-deprecated">Deprecated</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This function has been deprecated, please use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlPlaySound" target="_blank">llPlaySound</a> instead.</li>
    <li>If <b>sound</b> is missing from the prim's inventory and it is not a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> or it is not a sound then an error is shouted on <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/DEBUG_CHANNEL" target="_blank">DEBUG_CHANNEL</a>.</li>
    <li>If <b>sound</b> is a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> then there are no new <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Permissions/Asset" target="_blank">asset permissions</a> consequences for the object.
    <ul>
      <li>The resulting object develops no new usage restrictions that might have occurred if the asset had been placed in the prims inventory.</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function main()
    ll.Sound("sound", 1.0, true, false)
--Plays the sound once.
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        llSound("sound",1.0,TRUE,FALSE);
        //Plays the sound once.
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <th>Signature</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`
function void llSound( string sound, float volume, integer queue, integer loop );
`} lang="lsl" /></div>

</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

</DocsLayout>
      